From cea8ef72c63620290eb6d5659c227d2446dac890 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: packetloss404 <packetloss404@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 08:17:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] diaglog: opt-in structured log for the auth path and
 every external call

packetcode had no log. Diagnostics went to stderr, which the TUI owns and
which nobody captures; a session that went wrong while the operator was
away left only the transcript. PACKETCODE_LOG_FILE=<absolute path> now
appends one JSON object per line, mode 0600, from every command family.

Events: startup (version/commit), provider.http (method, URL without
query, attempt, status or transport error, ms) for every request through
DoWithRetry, codex.token_refresh, policy.decision and approval per tool
call (tool name only, never arguments), acp.session_new/load/close and
acp.permission, mcp.spawn, fetch (the full URL the model reached, minus
userinfo), ssh.connect, hook.run, sugar.login.

Never logged: bodies, headers, tool arguments, prompts, keys, tokens, or
URL query strings -- RedactURL strips them and ErrText strips them from
the URLs net/http embeds in *url.Error. Off by default; the discard
handler costs one interface call per site.

Audit patch P07 (dark-period hardening). Rollback: git revert this
commit; the variable is simply ignored afterwards.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
